OL,3,GNEWSAFirebomb killer was released by
OL,4,Apolice despite warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who murdered a mother and her
OL,7,Ffour children in a firebomb attack had
OL,8,Fbeen arrested and released by police a
OL,9,Ffortnight before, despite a judge
OL,10,Fhaving told him he was on his "last
OL,11,Fchance", an inquest has heard.
OL,13,FZak Bolland, 26, left a police station
OL,14,Fafter giving a 12-minute "no comment"
OL,15,Finterview for breaking windows at the
OL,16,Fhome of Michelle Pearson, 37, and her
OL,17,Fyoung family in Walkden, Salford,
OL,18,FGreater Manchester, on 26 November
OL,19,F2017.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
