OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFirebomb killer was released by
OL,4,Apolice despite warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FBolland's record was not checked at the
OL,7,Ftime and he was told no further action
OL,8,Fwould be taken, Bolton Coroner's Court
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FThirteen days later he petrol bombed
OL,12,Fthe house, killing the children and
OL,13,Fseverely burning their mother, who died
OL,14,F20 months later.
